{"id":104,"slug":"legion_commander","name":"军团指挥官","en":"Legion Commander","aliases":["军团","lc"],"attr":"str","attrLabel":"力量","attack":"近战","roles":["控制","核心","爆发","耐久","先手"],"positions":[3],"positionLabels":["3 号位"],"positionNames":["劣势路核心"],"lanes":["劣势路"],"complexity":1,"complexityLabel":"简单","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/legion_commander.png","art":"assets/heroes/art/legion_commander.jpg","card":"assets/heroes/cards/legion_commander.png","winrate":52.72,"pickrate":15.85,"trend":[52.69,52.7,52.93,52.76,52.49,52.87,52.29],"delta":-0.4,"pubPick":607745,"pubWin":320425,"proPick":0,"proWin":0,"proBan":3,"lore":"这是全无征兆的一天。石堂城的城墙里突然传来一阵轰隆隆的声响，一团黑色云雾出现，数不尽的魔兽大军从中奔涌而出，他们的魔火和邪术让所有人措手不及。城内的老弱妇孺纷纷惨遭毒手。曾经所向披靡的石堂城军队，古铜军团闻讯火速赶来响应。他们由未尝一败的指挥官特蕾丝汀带领军团开进城内，只见沿途的巷道溅满了鲜血，市集燃起了熊熊大火。士兵们从敌人中杀出一条血路，到达这次入侵的源头：石堂城的城市广场，虚无裂隙在其中央，旁边则是魔军骇人的首领。\r\n\t\t\t\t\n\n首领浑身笼罩着毁灭性的光芒，挥舞着一把大刀，他二话不说将一名士兵劈成了两半，只见尸首即刻开始腐烂。特蕾丝汀举起溅满鲜血的大刀，目光锁定在这怪物身上。他转过身来，对着她咧开嘴开始笑，牙齿乱得跟迷宫一般。他们全然不顾周遭的激烈战斗，向对方冲去。\r\n\t\t\t\t\n\n两人迅速缠斗在一起。每个招数都被对方挡下，两人的拼死决斗就如舞蹈一般行云流水，古铜军团的士兵则在他们周围一一倒下。特蕾丝汀见对手一刀向她劈来，她纵身一跃，跳到了敌人的身后。局势就此出现了逆转。敌人见状不妙，马上变招，劈砍变成横切，从侧面向她切去，这时她刚站稳，马上为之一振见招拆招。两刀相碰，特蕾丝汀顺势使劲，将刀柄下满是节瘤的敌爪斩下，场上顿时血光一片。其他魔兽见到如此场面早已惊呆，特蕾丝汀趁机发动强攻，将她的长刀刺进敌人的心脏。魔物一声仰天哀嚎，震散了天上的乌云，他在痛苦的扭曲中化成了滚滚淤血。深渊的门户开始颤栗，维系裂隙的力量就如突现一样消失的无影无踪。剩下的入侵者也很快倒在了石堂城的铁骑之下。\r\n\t\t\t\t\n\n尽管赢得了胜利，谁也没有心情庆祝：石堂城满目疮痍，伤亡无数。特蕾丝汀重新扬起战旗，召集了一群友军。她的愤怒随时都会爆发，誓要将深渊的魔物大军赶尽杀绝。谁敢作对，格杀勿论。","hype":"军团指挥官席卷整片战场，与落单的敌人一一单挑。每次决斗获胜后她出手的力量便增强一分，最后她就可以成为毫不留情的伊人之军。","npe":"每次决斗胜利都会提升攻击力","stats":{"health":670,"healthRegen":2.75,"mana":315,"manaRegen":1,"damage":"58–62","armor":2,"magicResistance":25,"moveSpeed":325,"attackRange":150,"attackRate":1.7,"turnRate":0.6,"sightDay":1800,"sightNight":800,"str":{"base":25,"gain":3},"agi":{"base":18,"gain":1.7},"int":{"base":20,"gain":2.2}},"abilities":[{"id":5595,"key":"legion_commander_overwhelming_odds","name":"压倒性优势","en":"Overwhelming Odds","desc":"用敌人的数量反制他们，对附近的所有敌人造成伤害，击中时施加100%减速，持续0.3秒。范围内每个敌方单位和英雄都会使伤害提升。另外还会向军团指挥官提供攻击速度加成。","lore":"石堂城的弓箭手就等特蕾丝汀一声令下。","notes":[],"shard":"压倒性优势的范围更大，会根据对敌方英雄造成的伤害提供全伤害护盾。","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"radius","label":"作用范围","value":"600","shard":"100"},{"key":"damage","label":"基础伤害","value":"40 / 70 / 100 / 130"},{"key":"damage_per_hero","label":"每个英雄提供伤害","value":"40 / 70 / 100 / 130"},{"key":"damage_per_unit","label":"每个小兵提供伤害","value":"14 / 16 / 18 / 20"},{"key":"bonus_attack_speed","label":"攻击速度加成","value":"50 / 75 / 100 / 125"},{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"6 秒"},{"key":"shield_per_damage_pct","label":"伤害转为护盾","value":"0%","shard":"50%"},{"key":"shield_duration","label":"护盾持续时间","value":"0 秒","shard":"6 秒"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"18 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"90 / 105 / 120 / 135"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/legion_commander_overwhelming_odds.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":true,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5596,"key":"legion_commander_press_the_attack","name":"强攻","en":"Press The Attack","desc":"移除友方目标单位的负面效果和控制技能，并提升其移动速度和生命恢复，持续一定时间。\n\n驱散类型：强驱散","lore":"古铜军团的重振号角可以鼓舞人心。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"提升移动速度，变为0范围型技能，而且使用时总是会作用于军团指挥官。","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"5 秒"},{"key":"move_speed","label":"移动速度加成","value":"13% / 16% / 19% / 22%","scepter":"12%"},{"key":"hp_regen","label":"生命恢复","value":"24 / 36 / 48 / 60"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"16 / 15 / 14 / 13 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"90"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"700"}],"type":"active","typeLabel":"主动","icon":"assets/abilities/legion_commander_press_the_attack.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true},{"id":5597,"key":"legion_commander_moment_of_courage","name":"勇气之霎","en":"Moment of Courage","desc":"每当受到攻击达到一定次数，军团指挥官都会对目标立即作出反击，而且此次攻击具有吸血效果。","lore":"特蕾丝汀知道，敌人出招最狠的时候也是他们最脆弱的时候。","notes":["只有在攻击他人时受到攻击才会触发带有吸血的反击。"],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"trigger_attacks","label":"触发所需攻击次数","value":"7 / 6 / 5 / 4"},{"key":"hp_leech_percent","label":"吸血","value":"55% / 65% / 75% / 85%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"0.3 秒"}],"type":"passive","typeLabel":"被动","icon":"assets/abilities/legion_commander_moment_of_courage.png","maxLevel":4,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":1483,"key":"legion_commander_outfight_them","name":"迎难而战！","en":"Outfight Them!","desc":"如果军团指挥官或附近1200范围内的友方英雄施放技能，他们会获得6秒的护甲加成；其中友军获得的数值为50%。这个加成效果独立叠加。","lore":"","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"armor","label":"护甲","value":"1"}],"chips":[],"type":"innate","typeLabel":"先天技能","icon":"assets/abilities/legion_commander_outfight_them.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5598,"key":"legion_commander_duel","name":"决斗","en":"Duel","desc":"军团指挥官强制与目标敌方英雄进行决斗，持续短暂的数秒。决斗开始后双方英雄不能使用任何物品，而目标敌方英雄不能使用技能。如果有英雄在决斗期间死亡，赢得决斗的英雄将永久获得攻击力加成。","lore":"与石堂城的士兵进行单挑是令人无法抗拒的挑战。","notes":["如果双方距离超过2000，决斗也会结束。"],"shard":"","scepter":"如果军团指挥官在决斗中获胜，会在她周围自动触发强攻。","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"4 / 4.5 / 5 秒"},{"key":"reward_damage","label":"攻击力加成","value":"10 / 20 / 30"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"60 / 55 / 50 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"80 / 100 / 120"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"200"}],"type":"ultimate","typeLabel":"终极技能","icon":"assets/abilities/legion_commander_duel.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":true}],"talents":[{"level":10,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_9","name":"--2秒 压倒性优势冷却","en":"-2s Overwhelming Odds Cooldown"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_outfight_them_armor","name":"+1 迎难而上！护甲","en":"+1 Outfight Them! Armor"}]},{"level":15,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_6","name":"+40 强攻生命恢复","en":"+40 Press The Attack HP Regen"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_4","name":"+35 压倒性优势英雄提供伤害","en":"+35 Overwhelming Odds Damage per Hero"}]},{"level":20,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_duel_duration","name":"+0.75秒 决斗持续时间","en":"+0.75s Duel Duration"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_3","name":"--1 勇气之霎触发需攻击次数","en":"-1 Moment of Courage Attacks To Trigger"}]},{"level":25,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_7","name":"+100% 勇气之霎吸血","en":"+100% Moment of Courage Lifesteal"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_legion_commander_duel_refresh_on_victory","name":"决斗胜利时减少30秒冷却","en":"Duel Advances Cooldown by 30s On Victory"}]}],"build":{"start_game_items":[{"slug":"branches","name":"铁树枝干","img":"assets/items/branches.png","cost":55,"count":185,"heat":100},{"slug":"gauntlets","name":"力量手套","img":"assets/items/gauntlets.png","cost":140,"count":112,"heat":60.54},{"slug":"tango","name":"树之祭祀","img":"assets/items/tango.png","cost":90,"count":83,"heat":44.86},{"slug":"quelling_blade","name":"压制之刃","img":"assets/items/quelling_blade.png","cost":100,"count":63,"heat":34.05},{"slug":"circlet","name":"圆环","img":"assets/items/circlet.png","cost":155,"count":54,"heat":29.19},{"slug":"magic_stick","name":"魔棒","img":"assets/items/magic_stick.png","cost":200,"count":44,"heat":23.78}],"start_game_items_label":"出门装","early_game_items":[{"slug":"boots","name":"速度之靴","img":"assets/items/boots.png","cost":500,"count":100,"heat":100},{"slug":"bracer","name":"护腕","img":"assets/items/bracer.png","cost":505,"count":93,"heat":93},{"slug":"chainmail","name":"锁子甲","img":"assets/items/chainmail.png","cost":500,"count":88,"heat":88},{"slug":"phase_boots","name":"相位鞋","img":"assets/items/phase_boots.png","cost":1450,"count":83,"heat":83},{"slug":"broadsword","name":"阔剑","img":"assets/items/broadsword.png","cost":1000,"count":49,"heat":49},{"slug":"splintmail","name":"片甲","img":"assets/items/splintmail.png","cost":950,"count":24,"heat":24}],"early_game_items_label":"前期","mid_game_items":[{"slug":"blink","name":"闪烁匕首","img":"assets/items/blink.png","cost":2250,"count":92,"heat":100},{"slug":"blade_mail","name":"刃甲","img":"assets/items/blade_mail.png","cost":2400,"count":88,"heat":95.65},{"slug":"ogre_axe","name":"食人魔之斧","img":"assets/items/ogre_axe.png","cost":1000,"count":51,"heat":55.43},{"slug":"broadsword","name":"阔剑","im